  "Description": "Crops an image or adds a frame around it.\n\nNegative values remove pixels at the edges; positive values add padding filled with PaddingColor. The output resolution changes accordingly.\n\nAKA: resize, frame, border, passepartout, trim\n\nSee also: [TransformImage]",
